# <%= title %> remote (polyrepo)

Own git repo. Platform clones it via:

```sh
bun run pull-remote --name <%= name %>
```

After first scaffold, push this folder to a private remote and set `"repo"` in
platform `packages/mf-config/remotes.json`.

## Tailwind

Import shared CSS in the **exposed** `App` (shell loads `./App`, not bootstrap):

```ts
import '@react-mfe/ui/styles/tailwind.css';
```

`createRemoteViteConfig` already registers `@tailwindcss/vite`.
